tegory_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"iwmW2mgcn2YdirXUHCsgXQ","review_id":"qfocIiPdoXNLB0cEe2WXlw","date":"2012-10-06T19:59:10","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9563035368919373,"text_excerpt":"So glad we tried this place, had a great experience. There was about an hour wait so we just stood over by the bar and some seats opened up so we just sat there. When they texted us that our table was ready we decided to stay and eat at the bar because we were having fun. The raw oysters were delicious and totally fresh. Someone near us ordered the oysters Rockefeller which was a huge plate of oysters that left everyone nearby awestruck. For dinner I had a red snapper special which was fantastic, and it was served with the skin. A restaurant has to be pretty bold to leave the skin on the fish (in the US, at least), and the fish absolutely has to be fresh or else the skin would taste terri..."},{"business_id":"iwmW2mgcn2YdirXUHCsgXQ","review_id":"O_Be0xFVoH18pFw12FU2uQ","date":"2012-03-27T00:29:49","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9548963308334351,"text_excerpt":"Came to Bourbon House for a large group dinner with a fixed menu. Props to our server Eric for being great, and patient with a few of our off-menu requesters- the restaurant was very accomodating. This is kind of a nice place. You walk in and can sit at the oyster bar, which is more casual, or the main dining room has opulent booths and tables in a lively but relaxed environment. The salads were fresh, the gumbo was good, and my gulf fish meuniere over red potatoes with asparagus a smash hit. The wine was flowing, but they didn't keep our large group sitting long just to run up the bar bill. For dessert we had the bread pudding, which had rich strips of melted chocolate, and it was incred..."},{"business_id":"iwmW2mgcn2YdirXUHCsgXQ","review_id":"J50DBIPYfvFDbRg5IvncFw","date":"2017-04-20T18:52:53","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9531995058059692,"text_excerpt":"We ate at Bourbon House during my first visit to New Orleans. The wait was understandable for a Saturday night so we happily got a drink at the bar. I enjoyed watching the oysters get shucked right there! Our waitress was very helpful giving many tips on favorite dishes, she even brought out Chef Cook. He talked with us for a while and recommended the charbroiled oysters. They were amazing! I have never had oysters prepared like this and I can't wait to return and enjoy them again. At the end of the evening I promised to come back to Bourbon House after I moved to New Orleans. I plan to bring my parents and close friends during all of their visits. This is a great date night spot and fun ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"iwmW2mgcn2YdirXUHCsgXQ","photo_id":"nfmQpGEuqY9qbTaWl9Psdg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/nfmQpGEuqY9qbTaWl9Psdg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8918406367301941},{"business_id":"iwmW2mgcn2YdirXUHCsgXQ","photo_id":"r9NzV9wzEifQrKgeyskJAw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/r9NzV9wzEifQrKgeyskJAw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8339530229568481},{"business_id":"iwmW2mgcn2YdirXUHCsgXQ","photo_id":"L18jpn_wbu6gRX6rqzwz3A","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/L18jpn_wbu6gRX6rqzwz3A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.799915075302124},{"busines